    11.2 Tests / validation (must pass):
         - (L/D)max ~ 12.2 and alpha_star ~ 6.05 deg computed from the formulas
         - equilibrium state is stationary: integrating 10 s from equilibrium at constant
           alpha keeps V and gamma within a small tolerance (density changes slightly
           with altitude in ISA mode — use constant rho for this test)
         - Vs formula: with m = 1156.7, S = 16.165, rho = 1.225, CL_max = 1.541 ->
           Vs ~ 27.3 m/s
         - CL continuous at alpha_stall
         - glide distance from h0 to h_end at alpha_star is close to
           (h0 - h_end) * (L/D)max (constant rho), within a few percent
         - HW part (d) mode runs and prod